# Regenerate: vhs docs/media/vasari-why.tape   (run from repo root)
Output docs/media/vasari-why.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1240
Set Height 600
Set Padding 22
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Hide
Type "export PATH=$HOME/.cargo/bin:$PATH; cd /tmp/gif2; clear"
Enter
Show

Sleep 600ms
Type "vasari why crates/vasari/src/main.rs:126"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 3800ms
Type "vasari why crates/vasari/src/main.rs:40"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 4200ms
